<aside class="consent-banner" data-consent-banner hidden aria-label="Analytics preferences">
  <div>
    <p class="consent-banner__title">A quieter kind of cookie notice</p>
    <p>We use optional analytics to understand which stays and venues guests find useful. Essential booking and enquiry features work either way.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="consent-banner__actions">
    <button class="button button--ghost button--small" type="button" data-consent-decline>Only essential</button>
    <button class="button button--primary button--small" type="button" data-consent-accept>Allow analytics</button>
  </div>
</aside>
